    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a569b4ca221ae12478507800",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哈哈哈……！有气魄！没错，就是要笑！\n我就做杯酒体有如红酒般厚重，\n基底是葡萄的无酒精鸡尾酒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "db65c12c467db4e9bba7f17d511b34fedfffd71433c596c29fd3bdf3e563a5ff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
