      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后我们三个人喝下\n她做的浓郁无酒精鸡尾酒，\n细细品味离别的余韵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a772205b7bb3c8996917094192cd32af2ef4001d2288919a36b5f755dca3cf4",
